WEBVTT

00:09.033 --> 00:10.667
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.733 --> 00:12.133
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.200 --> 00:14.100
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.167 --> 00:17.133
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:17.200 --> 00:19.233
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.300 --> 00:21.233
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.300 --> 00:23.133
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.200 --> 00:24.867
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.933 --> 00:27.267
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.333 --> 00:29.333
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.400 --> 00:31.200
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.267 --> 00:33.233
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:33.300 --> 00:35.100
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.167 --> 00:37.233
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.300 --> 00:39.367
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.433 --> 00:40.700
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.767 --> 00:42.567
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:45.367 --> 00:47.600
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:57.867 --> 01:05.167
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:11.800 --> 01:14.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:21.667 --> 01:22.767
- I wanted to be
- 我想成为

01:22.833 --> 01:24.600
mermaid man this year.
今年的美人鱼男。

01:24.667 --> 01:26.733
- Trick or treat.
- 不给糖就捣蛋。

01:28.667 --> 01:30.700
I love Halloween.
我喜欢万圣节。

01:32.400 --> 01:34.633
Whoa!
哇！

01:38.867 --> 01:41.067
- Ah!
- 啊！

01:43.633 --> 01:44.733
Hm...
嗯...

01:44.800 --> 01:45.800
Mm-hm.
嗯嗯。

01:45.867 --> 01:48.167
It's scary, but...
这很可怕，但是...

01:48.233 --> 01:55.467
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:58.933 --> 02:01.600
Oh. Hello.
哦。你好。

02:04.567 --> 02:07.833
[zapping, SpongeBob screams
and grunts]
[海绵宝宝尖叫声
和咕哝]

02:07.900 --> 02:11.500
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:11.567 --> 02:12.833
Hm...
嗯...

02:15.567 --> 02:17.233
- Hello!
- 你好！

02:17.300 --> 02:19.067
- Hello, Sir Patrick.
- 你好，帕特里克爵士。

02:19.067 --> 02:20.533
How do you like
my decorations?
你喜欢怎样
我的装饰品？

02:20.600 --> 02:23.067
[horse neighs,
decorations twinkle]
[马嘶声，
装饰品闪烁]

02:23.100 --> 02:24.333
- Those are too cute
- 那些太可爱了

02:24.400 --> 02:26.200
for Halloween, SpongeBob.
万圣节，海绵宝宝。

02:26.267 --> 02:28.567
- Oh, Patrick, Halloween
is cute.
- 哦，帕特里克，万圣节
很可爱。

02:28.633 --> 02:33.133
Sharing candy, holding hands,
singing songs.
分享糖果，牵手，
唱歌。

02:33.200 --> 02:35.200
It's a bright and cheery
time of year.
这是一个明亮而欢快的
一年中的某个时间。

02:35.267 --> 02:36.867
- I thought it was about
- 我以为是关于

02:36.933 --> 02:38.767
getting your pants scared off.
吓得你裤子都掉了

02:38.833 --> 02:41.067
Hey, where's your costume?
嘿，你的服装在哪里？

02:41.067 --> 02:42.633
Close your eyes.
闭上你的眼睛。

02:44.633 --> 02:45.633
Okay. Open 'em.
好的。打开它们。

02:46.900 --> 02:49.533
- * I'm a lovely flower *
- *我是一朵可爱的花*

02:49.600 --> 02:51.067
Ooh...
哦...

02:51.100 --> 02:53.533
- Oh, that's not scary
either, SpongeBob.
-哦，这并不可怕
要么，海绵宝宝。

02:53.600 --> 02:56.333
Wait, I'll show you
what's scary is.
等一下，我给你看
可怕的是。

03:01.100 --> 03:02.600
- Let's go to this house.
- 我们去这所房子吧。

03:02.667 --> 03:06.300
Oh...
There is no candy here...
哦...
这里没有糖果...

03:06.367 --> 03:09.167
- Only onions!
- 只有洋葱！

03:09.233 --> 03:11.667
Now move along.
现在继续前进。

03:11.733 --> 03:13.100
Ooh....
哦....

03:13.167 --> 03:14.633
- No candy.
- 没有糖果。

03:14.700 --> 03:15.967
That is so scary.
那太可怕了。

03:16.067 --> 03:17.900
Right, SpongeBob?
对吧，海绵宝宝？

03:17.967 --> 03:19.167
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:22.500 --> 03:24.700
SpongeBob, why are you hiding
in there?
海绵宝宝，你为什么躲起来
在那里？

03:24.767 --> 03:26.800
You'll miss all the
scary stuff.
你会错过所有的
可怕的东西。

03:26.867 --> 03:29.633
- I don't want to see
the scary stuff, Patrick.
- 我不想看到
可怕的事情，帕特里克。

03:29.700 --> 03:30.833
Okay? I admit it.
好的？我承认。

03:30.900 --> 03:32.400
I love trick-or-treating,
我喜欢“不给糖就捣蛋”

03:32.467 --> 03:34.467
but I am too afraid
to go out on Halloween!
但我太害怕了
万圣节出去玩！

03:34.533 --> 03:37.400
- SpongeBob, don't you know
the old saying?
- 海绵宝宝，你不知道吗
老话说？

03:37.467 --> 03:41.467
"The only thing you have
to fear is..."
“你唯一拥有的东西
恐惧是……”

03:41.533 --> 03:42.667
Yourself!
你自己！

03:42.733 --> 03:44.100
Aah!
啊啊！

03:44.167 --> 03:46.567
Stop staring at me like that!
No!
别再这样盯着我了！
不！

03:46.633 --> 03:49.700
See? It's all in your head,
SpongeBob.
看？一切都在你的脑海里
海绵宝宝。

03:49.767 --> 03:52.333
You just have to remember
one simple trick,
你只需要记住
一个简单的技巧，

03:52.400 --> 03:56.267
and that is:
scary equals funny.
那就是：
可怕等于有趣。

03:56.333 --> 03:59.400
- Scary equals funny.
- 可怕等于有趣。

03:59.467 --> 04:01.433
Hm. Never looked at it
that way before.
嗯。从来没看过
以前也是这样。

04:02.967 --> 04:04.200
Doink!
多因克！

04:04.267 --> 04:05.700
All right. I'll go out.
好的。我出去一下。

04:05.767 --> 04:07.700
[ghost squeaks,
SpongeBob screams]
[幽灵的尖叫声，
海绵宝宝尖叫]

04:09.100 --> 04:10.067
- Here I am.
- 我在这里。

04:11.267 --> 04:12.833
Just looking for cavities.
只是寻找蛀洞。

04:12.900 --> 04:14.133
Nope. None here.
没有。这里没有。

04:14.200 --> 04:15.767
Oh, let's go out
and get scared.
哦，我们出去吧
并感到害怕。

04:15.833 --> 04:18.500
both: Whoo!
两人：哇！

04:18.567 --> 04:20.300
- Sure you can handle this,
SpongeBob?
- 当然你能处理这个，
海绵宝宝？

04:20.367 --> 04:22.533
- Oh, I'll be fine, Patrick.
Really.
- 哦，我会没事的，帕特里克。
真的。

04:22.600 --> 04:24.833
But can we hold hands,
just in case you get scared?
但我们能牵手吗
以防万一你害怕？

04:24.900 --> 04:25.933
- Deal.
- 交易。

04:28.267 --> 04:30.400
both: Whoa...
两人：哇……

04:30.467 --> 04:32.400
- Welcome to my lab,
- 欢迎来到我的实验室，

04:32.467 --> 04:34.533
SpongeBob and Patrick.
海绵宝宝和帕特里克。

04:34.600 --> 04:39.700
I am the evil
Dr. Franken-Cheeks.
我就是邪恶
弗兰肯-奇克斯博士。

04:39.767 --> 04:40.933
- Oh, hi, Sandy.
-哦，嗨，桑迪。

04:41.067 --> 04:42.867
I didn't recognize you.
我没认出你来。

04:42.933 --> 04:44.967
- Uh, yeah, great costume.
- 呃，是的，很棒的服装。

04:45.067 --> 04:46.233
- Oh, thanks, guys.
-哦，谢谢，伙计们。

04:46.300 --> 04:48.400
Now, feast your fingers
现在，尽情享受手指吧

04:48.467 --> 04:50.633
on my jars of horror!
在我的恐怖罐子上！

04:53.233 --> 04:54.933
Stick your hand in the jar
将手伸进罐子里

04:55.067 --> 04:56.967
and guess what's inside...
猜猜里面有什么...

04:57.067 --> 05:00.267
If you dare!
如果你敢的话！

05:00.333 --> 05:02.067
- Oy.
- 哦。

05:02.067 --> 05:04.500
Ew. Oh.
呃。哦。

05:04.567 --> 05:06.867
Ew, it feels like worm guts.
呃，感觉就像虫子的内脏。

05:06.933 --> 05:08.167
- Wrong!
- 错误的！

05:08.233 --> 05:09.367
It's just noodles.
这只是面条。

05:10.800 --> 05:13.400
Oh, I'm savvy to this game,
Sandy.
哦，我对这个游戏很了解，
桑迪。

05:13.467 --> 05:16.900
So these brains are probably
a slimy head of lettuce,
所以这些大脑可能是
粘糊糊的生菜头，

05:16.967 --> 05:19.067
or maybe some boiled broccoli.
或者一些煮西兰花。

05:19.067 --> 05:21.133
- Wrong! It's--
- 错误的！它是 -

05:21.200 --> 05:23.267
Patrick?
Get out of there.
帕特里克？
离开那里。

05:23.333 --> 05:25.767
- Don't stop, SpongeBob.
That's the spot.
- 别停下来，海绵宝宝。
就是那个地方。

05:25.833 --> 05:26.900
Ah...
啊...

05:26.967 --> 05:28.867
- Patrick, you really got me.
- 帕特里克，你真的抓住了我。

05:33.967 --> 05:36.700
- Ew!
- 呃！

05:36.767 --> 05:39.167
How impolite of me!
我真是太无礼了！

05:39.233 --> 05:40.967
I forgot to introduce you
我忘记介绍你了

05:41.067 --> 05:43.067
to my little friend!
给我的小朋友！

05:43.067 --> 05:45.100
Oh....
哦....

05:45.167 --> 05:48.400
That's the most realistic
fake monster I ever saw.
这才是最现实的
我见过的假怪物。

05:50.433 --> 05:53.967
- Who are you
calling fake?
- 你是谁
还叫假的？

06:02.833 --> 06:04.167
- Fee,
- 费用，

06:04.233 --> 06:07.100
fie, fo, fum,
嗳、嗬、嗬、

06:07.167 --> 06:09.167
I smell the fear
我闻到了恐惧的味道

06:09.233 --> 06:11.833
of a scared SpongeBob!
害怕的海绵宝宝！

06:15.300 --> 06:17.233
Whoa!
哇！

06:17.300 --> 06:19.200
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:26.067 --> 06:27.567
- I love it!
- 我喜欢它！

06:27.633 --> 06:29.867
Oh, thank you, Sandy.
That was so much fun.
噢，谢谢你，桑迪。
那真是太有趣了。

06:29.933 --> 06:31.467
Patrick, you were right.
帕特里克，你是对的。

06:31.533 --> 06:33.367
Scary equals funny.
可怕等于有趣。

06:33.433 --> 06:34.800
all: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

06:39.333 --> 06:41.100
- Come in and see the horrors
- 进来看看恐怖的事情

06:41.167 --> 06:43.067
of the Chum Bucket.
密友桶的。

06:48.100 --> 06:52.667
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:52.733 --> 06:55.667
Ha, ha, ha, ha! I'm Plankton!
哈哈哈哈！我是浮游生物！

06:55.733 --> 06:57.467
Ha, ha, ha, I'm evil!
哈哈哈，我邪恶了！

07:06.833 --> 07:08.300
- Scary.
- 可怕的。

07:08.367 --> 07:10.367
- What are you two
laughing about?
-你们两个是什么
笑什么？

07:10.433 --> 07:12.600
There's nothing funny
about the food abuse
没有什么好笑的
关于食物滥用

07:12.667 --> 07:14.300
that goes on at
the Chum Bucket!
发生在
密友桶！

07:14.367 --> 07:16.500
You should be terrified!
你应该感到害怕！

07:16.567 --> 07:18.167
- Oh, sorry, Mr. Krabs,
- 哦，对不起，蟹老板，

07:18.233 --> 07:19.567
but our new philosophy is
但我们的新理念是

07:19.633 --> 07:21.800
"scary equals funny."
“可怕等于有趣。”

07:21.867 --> 07:24.967
- Yeah, and funny
divided by two idiots
- 是的，而且很有趣
被两个白痴分开

07:25.067 --> 07:26.667
equals stupid.
等于愚蠢。

07:26.733 --> 07:29.400
- I don't get it.
When I was a kid,
- 我不明白。
当我还是个孩子的时候，

07:29.467 --> 07:32.100
Halloween meant
24 continuous hours
万圣节的意思
24小时连续

07:32.167 --> 07:33.867
of screaming your head off!
尖叫你的头！

07:33.933 --> 07:35.300
These kids today...
今天这些孩子...

07:40.600 --> 07:42.533
Come to the Chum Bucket,
来到密友桶，

07:42.600 --> 07:46.500
and witness the horrors
of the Krusty Krab!
并见证恐怖事件
蟹堡王！

07:46.567 --> 07:50.167
You may never eat
a Krabby Patty again!
你可能永远不会吃东西
又来了蟹肉饼！

07:51.767 --> 07:54.100
- Ready for more funny,
Sir Clanks
- 准备好迎接更多有趣的事情，
叮当爵士

07:54.167 --> 07:55.400
- I'm driving!
- 我在开车！

07:56.933 --> 07:59.067
Charge!
收费！

08:00.233 --> 08:01.300
- Whoa!
- 哇！

08:09.533 --> 08:13.167
- Welcome
to the Chum Bucket.
- 欢迎
到密友桶。

08:13.233 --> 08:15.833
I'm Karen the cat.
我是猫凯伦。

08:16.733 --> 08:19.200
- Do the scary part.
- 做可怕的部分。

08:22.133 --> 08:24.400
Ooh, scary!
哦，可怕！

08:24.467 --> 08:27.300
That's nothing.
那没什么。

08:27.367 --> 08:29.867
Behold!
看哪！

08:29.933 --> 08:32.900
The horrors of the Krusty Krab.
蟹堡王的恐怖。

08:34.167 --> 08:35.333
Look down.
瞧不起。

08:37.067 --> 08:38.500
Oh.
- Ooh.
哦。
- 哦。

08:38.567 --> 08:42.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:42.767 --> 08:45.433
No dawdling! Step right up!
不磨磨蹭蹭！直接站起来吧！

08:45.500 --> 08:47.167
The evil Mr. Krabs
邪恶的蟹老板

08:47.233 --> 08:49.967
and his band of jolly,
mindless fools
和他的欢乐乐队，
无心的傻瓜

08:50.067 --> 08:52.400
stalk Bikini Bottom
by night
茎比基尼泳裤
到了晚上

08:52.467 --> 08:54.933
for delicious victims
为了美味的受害者

08:55.067 --> 08:57.067
then drag their
lifeless bodies
然后拖动他们的
无生命的尸体

08:57.100 --> 08:58.167
back to the kitchen,
回到厨房，

08:58.233 --> 08:59.433
and grind them
并磨碎它们

08:59.500 --> 09:01.500
into grinders!
进入研磨机！

09:04.633 --> 09:07.600
Oh, Plankton,
you are a panic.
哦，浮游生物，
你很恐慌。

09:08.800 --> 09:11.667
You're eating it!
你正在吃它！

09:11.733 --> 09:13.733
Krabby Patties are people!
蟹黄饼是人！

09:13.800 --> 09:15.567
They're people patties!
他们是人肉饼！

09:15.633 --> 09:18.200
You're eating people patties!
你这是在吃人肉饼啊！

09:32.267 --> 09:34.267
Come on!
快点！

09:51.567 --> 09:54.367
- Ah! Music to me ears.
- 啊！音乐传到我耳边。

09:54.433 --> 09:56.700
Halloween night,
and everyone is
万圣节之夜，
每个人都是

09:56.767 --> 09:59.233
getting their bloomers
scared off!
得到他们的灯笼裤
吓跑了！

09:59.300 --> 10:02.233
This holiday is the worst!
这个假期最惨了！

10:02.300 --> 10:05.433
Wait a moment.
稍等。

10:05.500 --> 10:08.233
That kid isn't
screaming with fear.
那个孩子不是
恐惧地尖叫。

10:25.167 --> 10:26.900
- Scare and release!
- 吓唬然后释放！

10:28.533 --> 10:30.500
I love this job.
我喜欢这份工作。

10:37.833 --> 10:39.200
Ugh.
啊。

10:39.267 --> 10:41.067
Who dares to laugh
谁敢笑

10:41.133 --> 10:42.933
at All Hallows' Eve?
在万圣节前夕？

10:43.000 --> 10:45.433
I'm going to find out.
我要去找出答案。

10:45.500 --> 10:48.533
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:55.300 --> 10:56.600
Gee, who would've thought
哎呀，谁能想到

10:56.667 --> 10:58.467
I'd be laughing myself silly
tonight?
我会笑自己傻
今晚？

10:58.533 --> 11:00.633
- You!
- 你！

11:02.467 --> 11:04.100
You dare to laugh
你还敢笑

11:04.167 --> 11:06.433
on Halloween?
在万圣节？

11:11.933 --> 11:14.600
Aren't you afraid
of scary things?
你不害怕吗
可怕的事情？

11:14.667 --> 11:16.867
- Well, I was,
until I found out that
- 嗯，我当时，
直到我发现

11:16.933 --> 11:18.867
scary equals funny.
可怕等于有趣。

11:24.800 --> 11:27.200
I love this guy!
我爱这个家伙！

11:29.267 --> 11:30.233
- I don't get it.
- 我不明白。

11:30.300 --> 11:31.433
How could anyone
怎么会有人

11:31.500 --> 11:33.767
confuse scary with funny?
混淆恐怖和搞笑？

11:36.400 --> 11:40.867
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:40.933 --> 11:43.733
Hm. No wonder
you're not scared.
嗯。难怪
你不害怕。

11:43.800 --> 11:46.667
These decorations
are laughable!
这些装饰品
可笑！

11:48.333 --> 11:50.233
I'm sorry, kid.
对不起，孩子。

11:50.300 --> 11:54.133
I had no idea
how fright-deprived you were.
我不知道
你是多么缺乏恐惧啊。

11:54.200 --> 11:55.733
Not to worry.
不用担心。

11:55.800 --> 11:58.367
You're in bad hands!
你的手不好！

12:01.500 --> 12:02.467
* *
**
